WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.106
Hi! Which pet do pupils like best? Draw the answers as pictures and you can tell at a glance. Today we'll read picture graphs.

2
00:00:11.256 --> 00:00:15.210
In this picture graph, each picture stands for 1.

3
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.970
Count each row: 5 like cats, 3 like dogs and 6 like fish.

4
00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:25.410
The row with the most pictures is the most popular: fish.

5
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:31.146
The row with the fewest pictures is the least popular: dog.

6
00:00:31.296 --> 00:00:36.378
How many more like fish than dogs? 6 minus 3 is 3.

7
00:00:36.528 --> 00:00:42.186
How many pupils altogether? 5 plus 3 plus 6 is 14.

8
00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:46.530
When drawing, make the pictures the same size and line them up.

9
00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:51.306
Read each row's label first, then count.

10
00:00:51.456 --> 00:00:55.410
Watch out! Bigger pictures don't mean more!

11
00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:58.770
Count how many pictures are in each row.

12
00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:03.378
The row with the most pictures is the most.

13
00:01:03.528 --> 00:01:11.586
Your turn! How many pupils like cats? Pause and think.

14
00:01:11.736 --> 00:01:18.258
The cat row has 5 pictures: 5 pupils. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:18.408 --> 00:01:27.018
Another one! Which pet is liked by the most pupils? Pause and think.

16
00:01:27.168 --> 00:01:32.346
Fish has 6, the most. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:32.496 --> 00:01:41.298
Here's another! Which pet is liked by the fewest pupils? Pause and think.

18
00:01:41.448 --> 00:01:47.034
Dog has only 3, the fewest. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:47.184 --> 00:01:56.322
Try one more! How many more pupils like cats than dogs? Pause and think.

20
00:01:56.472 --> 00:02:01.818
5 minus 3 is 2. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:01.968 --> 00:02:10.530
Try one more! How many pupils are there altogether? Pause and think.

22
00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:16.890
5 plus 3 plus 6 is 14. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:26.130
Try one more! How many more pupils like fish than cats? Pause and think.

24
00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:31.650
6 minus 5 is 1. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:41.826
Last one! 2 more pupils like dogs. How many like dogs now? Pause and think.

26
00:02:41.976 --> 00:02:47.082
3 plus 2 is 5. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:47.232 --> 00:02:54.690
Remember: read each row's label, then count the pictures. Subtract to compare, add to find the total.

28
00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:00.281
Ask your family their favourite fruit and draw a picture graph!

